    "body": "Another reason why `dir=\"auto rtl\"` (or just inheritance of `dir`) is needed:\r\n\r\n![dir auto rtl](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1473102/79201570-233ad200-7ded-11ea-911f-e4410a993eb2.png)\r\n\r\nI.e., weak characters align left. (The text in the picture is: \"Answer the question\\n1- ______\")\r\n\r\nDemo: https://codepen.io/mustafa0x/pen/mdeerOp\r\n\r\nSo `dir=auto`'s direction should default to the document's in cases where it lacks a cue.",
